      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_answer_01",
      "hash64": "BBCCB6E23E50C0E7",
      "text": "……錯誤！\\n海哲是探險記的作者。\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳把這堂課和上一堂課搞混了。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
