    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_answer_02",
      "hash64": "BBCCB7E23E50C29A",
      "text": "……正確答案！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳才剛轉學來就知道這件事，\\r\\n真是熱心向學啊。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_answer_03",
      "hash64": "BBCCB8E23E50C44D",
      "text": "錯誤……不，就某種角度來說，\\n也算是正確答案……？[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
